<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<!--
    HSK patch: gate VFE Pirates Junker raids behind a minimum raid-points
    threshold so they don't appear in early-game / low-wealth / tribal
    scenarios.

    Why?
    The Junker faction is industrial-tier (warcasket pirates with guns and
    SMGs), but its weakest pawn — VFEP_Scrapper — has a combat power of
    only 65. That means at 25k wealth on day 4 of a Neolithic Norbal start,
    the storyteller's raid budget (~200-400 points) is enough to fit
    3-5 scrappers and the Junker faction qualifies as a raid source.
    Result: tribal stone-age colony gets raided by industrial pirates with
    shotguns and SMGs.

    Fix: every <pawnGroupMaker> for Junkers gets <minTotalPoints>800</minTotalPoints>.
    Below 800 raid points (~50k+ wealth, well past early game), the
    storyteller can't pick any Junker group and falls back to a more
    appropriate faction (tribal raiders, basic mercenaries, etc.). At
    higher wealth the pirates kick in normally.

    Mercenaries (VFEP_Mercenaries, the other faction in this file) are
    NOT gated — they're a milder mid-tier faction without warcasket and
    don't feel out-of-place in early-game raids.

    800 was picked as a midpoint between vanilla "low" raid (~200-400)
    and "moderate" raid (~600-1000). Tune up if pirates still feel too
    early, down if they never appear.
-->
<Patch>

    <!-- Junker faction: 4 pawnGroupMakers, each gets minTotalPoints. -->
    <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="VFEP_Junkers"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[1]</xpath>
        <value>
            <minTotalPoints>800</minTotalPoints>
        </value>
    </Operation>

    <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="VFEP_Junkers"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[2]</xpath>
        <value>
            <minTotalPoints>800</minTotalPoints>
        </value>
    </Operation>

    <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="VFEP_Junkers"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[3]</xpath>
        <value>
            <minTotalPoints>800</minTotalPoints>
        </value>
    </Operation>

    <Operation Class="PatchOperationAdd">
        <xpath>Defs/FactionDef[defName="VFEP_Junkers"]/pawnGroupMakers/li[4]</xpath>
        <value>
            <minTotalPoints>800</minTotalPoints>
        </value>
    </Operation>

</Patch>
